WEBVTT

1
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:23,820
Six-year-old senior brother genius

2
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:24,740
What a genius

3
00:00:26,790 --> 00:00:30,230
The transfer from the leader is wrong

4
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:31,630
I was drugged

5
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:32,990
I can't use my true energy to exert my strength

6
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:36,220
Otherwise, how could I lose to Senior Brother Hou?

7
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:39,580
If you lose, you lose. Why slander people? I didn’t slander.

8
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:41,300
The energy in my body is definitely not right

9
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:42,580
You are of the same lineage

10
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:44,420
He must have used his hands and feet to act arrogantly.

11
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:46,340
If you lose, say you were drugged.

12
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:48,140
This is the disciple of the leader

13
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:51,220
Who doesn’t know that you have long wanted to seize power fairly and justly?

14
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,220
You must have poisoned yourself in the crime.

15
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:54,860
Obviously you are the one who remembers me

16
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:56,060
If you can’t explain, don’t compare.

17
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:57,460
What nonsense are you talking to them about?

18
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:02,900
The brothers from Da Zhang Lao's lineage started to fight against Da Zhang Lao

19
00:01:02,900 --> 00:01:05,380
Long live the fight for wealth

20
00:01:09,470 --> 00:01:17,660
It was fun when we started fighting. It was really fun. Let’s just watch the show and stop telling lies.

21
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:18,580
Got beaten up

22
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:20,800
of course i know

23
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,240
This is civil strife that I started with my own hands

24
00:01:24,910 --> 00:01:26,750
I was the one who poisoned Hou Fangjie

25
00:01:27,820 --> 00:01:28,940
That poison was mixed in the wine

26
00:01:29,420 --> 00:01:30,860
When Hou Fangjie drank it

27
00:01:30,860 --> 00:01:33,940
He smiled and nodded to me and opened the door.

28
00:01:34,340 --> 00:01:37,900
Invite some of our friends. There are many friends outside.
